# Build context for the web image (context is the repo root so the build can
# use the single workspace lockfile). Everything below is either unnecessary in
# the image, secret, or an artifact that must never be copied in.
#
# Copying web/build in particular is what broke hydration: Tailwind's source
# scanning picked up a previous build's output during the server pass and
# emitted a different stylesheet than the client pass. app.css now scopes its
# sources explicitly, and keeping build artifacts out of the context removes the
# second way that can happen.

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Dependencies are installed inside the image from the lockfile.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build artifacts.
web/build
web/.react-router
api/bin

# Not needed to build or run the web service.
api
infra
docs
scripts
firebase.json
firestore.rules
firestore.indexes.json
README.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md

# Secrets and local state.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
